/T (Electrical Parts: PLC: Programmable Logic Controller \(Using Amoman Delta or Siemens brand\) - Controls the timing and logic of the whole machine. HMI \(Touch Screen\): Human Machine Interface \(Touch Panel\) - To set the packing speed, pouch size and temperature. Photocell \(Camera/Eye\): High sensitivity photoelectric sensor to track the printing on the film and make a straight cut. Temperature Controller: For heating sealing jaw \(with solid state relay-SSR\). Main Breaker: 65 Ampere \(For heavy load and protection of the machine\). Button: On/Off push button or emergency stop button for safety. Body Material: Stainless Steel \(SS304 or SS316\) - For hygiene and rust resistance. Original: Electrical components \(PLC, HMI, PhotoCell, Motors\) are made in China, which are used in standard packing machines.)
